Clawd desktop app

clawd_desktop/usage.py and clawd_desktop/events.py started as copies of the
Clawdmeter daemon (claude_usage_daemon.py, clawd_events.py) by Hermann
Bjorgvin and contributors, https://github.com/HermannBjorgvin/Clawdmeter,
extended for the clawd desk clock. Upstream Clawdmeter carries no license
file; credit and thanks go to its authors. If you are an author and want this
code removed or relicensed, please open an issue.

This repository contains no firmware, fonts, animation packs or Clawd
artwork. The tray icon is drawn in code (clawd_desktop/icons.py).

Claude, Claude Code and Clawd are trademarks of Anthropic. This project is
not affiliated with or endorsed by Anthropic. It reads your own Claude Code
login on your own computer to ask Anthropic's usage endpoint for your usage;
the token never leaves your machine except to api.anthropic.com.
